* gw  98-08-03 p(172630) every 100th line blanked out on asa -> ebcdic
* sju 99-06-28 p(183721) new printer exit return code 97 (means don't
*                        call again until next report separator)
* sju 99-07-02 p(183948) first column lost if report has no cc but
*                        printer does
* fhi 00-08-24 QA03      Use NAT23006 for error values
* sju 01-01-04 p(204718) p(183948) has undesirable side-effects for BS2
* sju 02-10-09 nom221    XML printers
* fhi 2003-07-29 P(227985) Clear unused modules
* xsetggr 04-03-10 p(250355) correct record length for work files
* sju     2004-04-22 p(250355) correct handling of recfm/lrecl
* NOTE: for performance reasons (WRITE WORK much faster than VARIABLE)
*       RECFM=F is always written with LRECL 251
* HH      2004-08-10 HH UMSTELLUNG VON HEX-CODE H'40'
* xsetggr 2004-11-23 p(258871) recat due to changes in rmfl---p
* sju     2004-12-14 TYPE=AL   NOM31 support TYPE=AL
* xsetggr 2007-05-02 NOM3201   Support 5 byte node numbers
* fhi     2007-07-12 NOM3202   C-NATERR changed, NAD23006 is obsolete.
* fhi     2007-07-17 NRT2422   print binary documents
* xsetggr 2007-09-04 NRT2184   Support P11 format run numbers
* xsetggr 2007-11-05 NRT2768   Show size of binary documnets in bytes
* fhi     2008-03-04 P302167   binary documents not printed
* xsetggr 2008-06-10 p(292935) fill po-printed only after sucessful end
*                               of printing
* fhi     2008-06-20 P306371   Redefintion misused, WKF-NUMBER destroyed
* fhi     2009-03-18 p315479   perform close processing under unix
* xsetggr 2010-03-31 P307403   delete test print
* fhi     2010-09-03 NOMALL-97 Extend message line
